Subject: [PATCH] Add PromptOuput Node for corpus collection

---
 .../prompts/PromptOutput/PromptOutput.ts      | 86 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../nodes/prompts/PromptOutput/prompt.svg     |  5 ++
 2 files changed, 91 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 packages/components/nodes/prompts/PromptOutput/PromptOutput.ts
